OL,3,GNEWSAMoray councillor continues to
OL,4,Acarry out council duties after moving
OL,5,Ato Egypt
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Moray councillor has been continuing
OL,8,Fto carry out his council duties while
OL,9,Fliving almost 3,500 miles away in
OL,10,FEgypt.
OL,12,FIndependent councillor Neil McLennan,
OL,13,Foriginally elected to represent the
OL,14,FConservatives, has held a seat in the
OL,15,FBuckie and Findochty ward since May
OL,16,F2022.
OL,18,FHe is now listed and pictured as a
OL,19,Fdeputy head in the secondary school
OL,20,Fleadership team on Malvern College's
OL,21,Fwebsite and Facebook page, a British
OL,22,Finternational school in Cairo.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
