OL,3,GNEWSAMoray councillor continues to
OL,4,Acarry out council duties after moving
OL,5,Ato Egypt
OL,6,
OL,7,FAccording to Moray Council guidelines,
OL,8,Fcouncillors must live in the area at
OL,9,Fthe time of election but do not need to
OL,10,Freside there once in position.
